# Project Status

## Project Name
DevOps Monitoring Platform

## Goal
A production-like monitoring platform that tracks website/API uptime, collects response time statistics, and displays live monitoring data through an Angular dashboard. Built as a portfolio project demonstrating full-stack .NET + Angular development with Docker containerisation.

