## Running the Project

### Local development
```powershell
# Terminal 1 — backend
cd Monitoring.Api && dotnet run

# Terminal 2 — frontend
cd monitoring-dashboard && ng serve
```
Open `http://localhost:4200`

### Docker (full stack)
```powershell
docker-compose up
```
Open `http://localhost:4200`  
Swagger: `http://localhost:5158/swagger`
